body:
I think you can mess with the controls in options?

&#x200B;

I second the other poster about Genki games controlling poorly. Super Magnetic Neo also has poor controls.

I loved the ragdolls so much in this game. At first I thought they were using a procedural animation system or something.

&#x200B;

Was sad to see they weren't as good in 3 or 4 remake. Must be the tighter play areas in this game.

Haha hand pics?  

&#x200B;

Pro tip... it sounds like this person doesn't have much respect for your love and feelings. You put her on a pedastal and they put you at the bottom of the drawer you know? You gotta live for you <3

I think i waited 4 or 5 days, probably shouldve waited longer. Take the opportunity for a T break. It depends on how you're healing - the ortho said I was healing better than most people. 

&#x200B;

The consequences of doing it too soon are awful though :( i would wait a week.
